{
 "about": "Backgrounds of the landing page, made with Google Flow: stills with Nano Banana Pro and Nano Banana 2.1 (0 credits), clips with Veo 3.1 Fast (20 credits each, 8 s, 720p). Look: matte graphite terraces, brushed gold, clear ribbed glass, in the style of the picture the user gave on 25 November 2026. The gold object is the project's own mark (a disc cut into two halves). No bank logo, no text, no faces and no real banknotes were asked for; the bills are an invented design.",
 "colours": {
  "bcc_green": "#00B975",
  "bcc_gold": "#DCA262",
